      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e GCC has a bug where it drops tokens after escaped quotes inside macros.\n\u003e That caused the static assert statment in HWY_BEFORE_NAMESPACE() and\n\u003e HWY_AFTER_NAMESPACE() to be dropped. Thus the extra semi warnings.\n\nIt would be good to add a reference to the bug. Was it fixed in GCC 16+?",
